		}
		{
			description: [
				"This is where our craft stops being gardening and starts being language."
				""
				"You lay materials around it, pour mana in, and it gives back a rune: a fixed idea, reusable. Every serious thing you make from here needs one."
			]
			id: "62CAC52551F5CB5E"
			rewards: [{
