		}
		{
			description: [
				"Here is a thing I want you to find out for yourself, so I will only point."
				""
				"Go underground. Look for a green-white ore in the livingrock. When you find it, remember every book that told you Elementium comes through the gate."
				""
				"It does not. It is ours. It was always under our feet. They had the gate and we had the mine, and we let them tell the story."
			]
			id: "3DF099AA2941DC13"
			rewards: [{
				count: 2
				id: "259B502F6D1068AD"
