			title: "What The Ground Keeps"
			x: 9.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"The other tradition needs its own timber."
				""
				"Archwood grows in the quieter valleys. You will hear it before you see it. Do not ask me how it does that; it is not my art."
