			x: 6.0d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"A Mana Pool holds what your spreaders throw at it. Simple enough."
				""
				"But there is a second recipe for a smaller pool, and it looks like a saving. It is not. The Diluted Pool holds a tenth as much and every guide that ever ruined a beginner recommended it as a starter."
				""
				"Build the full pool. You will fill it slowly and then never think about it again."
			]
			id: "111EF5AD35A22349"
			optional: true
			shape: "gear"
			subtitle: "Magister Velrous"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1984079630670D8B"
				title: "The Pool, And The Diluted Trap"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "The Pool, And The Diluted Trap"
			x: 0.0d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"A spreader throws a physical burst. The burst travels, and anything in the way stops it."
				""
				"A leaf. A fence. Your own scaffolding. If a spreader is not filling a pool, the answer is almost never mana and almost always a block you forgot you placed."
				""
				"Stand where the spreader stands and look. If you cannot see the pool, neither can it."
			]
			id: "6F090ACC10977D48"
			optional: true
			shape: "gear"
			subtitle: "Magister Velrous"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1BBFFB1E282EF09A"
				title: "Line Of Sight, Not Distance"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Line Of Sight, Not Distance"
			x: 1.5d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"A burst loses mana as it flies. Not much over a short hop; a great deal over a long one."
				""
				"Two short throws beat one long one, which is why our workshops are cramped and full of relays rather than elegant and spread out. Efficiency here looks like clutter."
			]
			id: "513E628B69F47DF2"
			optional: true
			shape: "gear"
			subtitle: "Magister Velrous"
			tasks: [{
				id: "10D13B5CCCE5147F"
				title: "Distance Costs"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Distance Costs"
			x: 3.0d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"The pool does not travel. The tablet does."
				""
				"Fill it at the pool, carry it to the work, and it will feed a rod or a tool in the field. It is the difference between a workshop and an expedition."
			]
			id: "755D79EB820165D3"
			optional: true
			shape: "gear"
			subtitle: "Magister Velrous"
			tasks: [{
				id: "791C1B152FE01346"
				title: "Mana You Can Carry"
