			x: 1.5d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"The Fey Altar takes five offerings. Not four, not six."
				""
				"Every recipe in their tradition is built on five, and a short offering simply does not resolve. If an altar is refusing you, count again before you blame the recipe."
			]
