			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"Human magic sorts itself into schools, and a book is loyal to one of them."
				""
				"A copper book holds little and casts slowly. What it teaches you is the shape of the system: schools, cooldowns, and a mana bar that is not Botania's and not Ars Nouveau's."
				""
				"Four energy systems now, if you are counting. I did warn you."
			]
			id: "622D471E0C821D02"
			optional: true
