			x: 4.5d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"Here is the join, and it is the most important thing in this era."
				""
				"Mana can be bottled. Once it is a fluid in a container it is a fluid Create can pump, measure and pipe - and the moment that is true, the industry of the dead world runs on elven power."
				""
				"That is the whole design of this pack in one item. Nothing in Create will be allowed to matter unless it drinks from a spine first."
			]
